function yf3Crystal(u){const hues=[['#fff','#ffb3e2'],['#fff','#9ff0ff'],['#fff','#d6c4ff'],['#fff','#b3ffd9'],['#fff','#fff1a8'],['#fff','#ffc4a8'],['#fff','#9fc8ff']];let d='',s='';
 hues.forEach(([a,b],i)=>{d+=yf3Lin(u+'c'+i,[[0,a,.95],[1,b,.55]],0,0,1,0);const t=i/(hues.length-1),ang=-82+100*t,len=46+24*Math.sin(Math.PI*Math.min(1,t*1.4))-t*16,w=7+2.5*(1-t);
  s+='<path transform="rotate('+ang.toFixed(1)+')" d="M0,0L'+(len*.42).toFixed(1)+','+(-w).toFixed(1)+'L'+len.toFixed(1)+',0L'+(len*.42).toFixed(1)+','+w.toFixed(1)+'Z" fill="url(#'+u+'c'+i+')" stroke="#fff" stroke-width=".7"/><path transform="rotate('+ang.toFixed(1)+')" d="M'+(len*.42).toFixed(1)+','+(-w).toFixed(1)+'L'+(len*.55).toFixed(1)+',0L'+(len*.42).toFixed(1)+','+w.toFixed(1)+'" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".7" stroke-width=".5"/>';});
 return [d,s];}

